**Anglian Water** {% term integration %} is used to integrate with the smart meters of [Anglian Water](https://www.anglianwater.co.uk).

## Supported devices

- Smart water meters
- Enhanced smart water meters

## Unsupported devices

The following devices are not supported by the integration:

- Basic water meters

